---
title: Error Aggregation in Batch Operations
---

flowchart TB
    subgraph Input["Input Operations"]
        O1["Op 1 ✓"]
        O2["Op 2 ✗"]
        O3["Op 3 ✓"]
        O4["Op 4 ✗"]
        O5["Op 5 ✓"]
    end

    subgraph Collection["Result Collection"]
        direction LR
        S["Successes<br/>[(0, R1), (2, R3), (4, R5)]"]
        F["Failures<br/>[(1, E2), (3, E4)]"]
    end

    subgraph Analysis["Result Analysis"]
        A{All Succeeded?}
        B{All Failed?}
        C{Has Partial?}
    end

    subgraph Output["Output Decision"]
        D["Return [R1, R3, R5]"]
        E["Throw allFailed([E2, E4])"]
        G{throwOnAnyFailure?}
        H["Throw partialFailure(3, [E2, E4])"]
        I["Return BatchResult"]
    end

    O1 & O2 & O3 & O4 & O5 --> Collection
    S --> A
    F --> A

    A -->|Yes| D
    A -->|No| B
    B -->|Yes| E
    B -->|No| C
    C -->|Yes| G
    G -->|Yes| H
    G -->|No| I

